            <fr:taxon>definition</fr:taxon>
          </fr:frontmatter>
          <fr:mainmatter>
            <html:p>Define a grammar <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[A]]></fr:tex> to be <html:em>finitely unambiguous</html:em> if <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[A \And  A \cong  A]]></fr:tex>.</html:p>
            <html:p>There is likely a better name for this.</html:p>
          </fr:mainmatter>
