            </fr:date>
            <fr:uri>https://stevenschaefer.net/sss-001U/</fr:uri>
            <fr:display-uri>sss-001U</fr:display-uri>
            <fr:route>/sss-001U/</fr:route>
            <fr:title text="Unambiguity as Unique Map into Codomain">Unambiguity as Unique Map into Codomain</fr:title>
            <fr:taxon>definition</fr:taxon>
          </fr:frontmatter>
          <fr:mainmatter>
            <html:p>A grammar <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[A]]></fr:tex> is <html:em>unambiguous</html:em> if for all grammars <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[B]]></fr:tex> and maps <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[e , e' : A \vdash  B]]></fr:tex> we have <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[e = e']]></fr:tex>.</html:p>
            <html:p>In a category with terminal objects, this is equivalent to unambiguity defined via subterminality.</html:p>
            <fr:tree show-metadata="false">
              <fr:frontmatter>
                <fr:authors>
                  <fr:author>
                    <fr:link href="/stevenschaefer/" title="Steven Schaefer" uri="https://stevenschaefer.net/stevenschaefer/" display-uri="stevenschaefer" type="local">Steven Schaefer</fr:link>
                  </fr:author>
                </fr:authors>
                <fr:date>
                  <fr:year>2025</fr:year>
                  <fr:month>2</fr:month>
                  <fr:day>12</fr:day>
                </fr:date>
                <fr:uri>https://stevenschaefer.net/sss-001T/</fr:uri>
                <fr:display-uri>sss-001T</fr:display-uri>
                <fr:route>/sss-001T/</fr:route>
                <fr:title text="Unambiguity as Subterminality">Unambiguity as Subterminality</fr:title>
                <fr:taxon>definition</fr:taxon>
              </fr:frontmatter>
              <fr:mainmatter>
                <html:p>A grammar <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[A]]></fr:tex> is <html:em>unambiguous</html:em> if the unique map into the <fr:link href="/sss-001O/" title="Terminal Object" uri="https://stevenschaefer.net/sss-001O/" display-uri="sss-001O" type="local">terminal object</fr:link> is a monomorphism. That is, <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[A]]></fr:tex> is a subobject of <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\top ]]></fr:tex>.</html:p>
              </fr:mainmatter>
            </fr:tree>
          </fr:mainmatter>
        </fr:tree>
